{"id":"cualquiera","lemma":"cualquiera","pos":"pron","rank":594,"glosses":["anyone, whoever, whomever"],"ipa":"/kwalˈkjeɾa/","forms":{"plural":"cualesquiera"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/ca/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Eavqwiki-cualquiera.wav","examples":[{"text":"Cualquiera de vosotros puede hacerlo.","en":"Any of you can do it.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/39712","words":[null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"you all"},{"g":"to be able to, can","l":"poder"},{"g":"to do","l":"hacer"}]},{"text":"Si cualquiera puede hacerlo, tú también puedes.","en":"If anyone can do it, you can.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/641794","words":[{"g":"if, whether"},null,{"g":"to be able to, can","l":"poder"},{"g":"to do","l":"hacer"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"also, too, as well"},{"g":"to be able to, can","l":"poder"}]},{"text":"Podría haber sido cualquiera de nosotros.","en":"It could've been any one of us.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/568507","words":[{"g":"to be able to, can","l":"poder"},{"g":"to have"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"we"}]},{"text":"Eso lo puede hacer cualquiera.","en":"Anyone can do that.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/449900","words":[{"g":"that","l":"ése"},{"g":"it / him"},{"g":"to be able to, can","l":"poder"},{"g":"to do"},null]},{"text":"Cualquiera pudo hacer esto.","en":"Anybody could do this.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/454023","words":[null,{"g":"to be able to, can","l":"poder"},{"g":"to do"},{"g":"this"}]}]}